From a4b80d76ad1a9bf89e0483984953583048e31122 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zhaosiying12138 <neucszhaopeng2016@163.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 16:00:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 21/42] amdgpu: execute locked generic dispatch on GPU

Route the exact owner-bound gpuReadWrite fixture through GPUDispatcher and ComputeUnit only after the type-19 ACK is durable. Preserve the bit-8 control path while bit 9 binds the wide wire token to a bounded dispatch ID, validates the locked ABI and output oracle, and emits type-20 only after physical retirement.

Retain queue, signal, memory, packet, and adapter ownership through completion or disconnected-owner quarantine. The accepted scope is one locked native execution lifecycle; it does not claim general gfx950 execution, compilation, JIT, or fallback.

